# Deny-by-default build context: Docker never receives state, Git metadata,
# credentials, local .venv, CI reports or anything outside the four UI assets.
*
!docker/
!docker/studio.Dockerfile
!engineering-lab/
!engineering-lab/serve.py
!engineering-lab/index.html
!engineering-lab/style.css
!engineering-lab/app.js
!engineering-lab/missions.json
